    When I attempt to sign in with an incorrect password for "<username>" five times within fifteen minutes
    Then the system refuses the sixth sign-in with "TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS"
    And the account is locked for five minutes

  Examples:
    | username |
    | alice   |
    | bob     |

  Scenario Outline: User signs in successfully after lockout period
