    And the account is locked for five minutes
    Then the system refuses the sixth sign-in with "TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS"
    And the account remains locked until after five minutes have passed
    When I try to sign in again with the correct password for "<username>"
    Then the sign-in is successful

  Examples:
    | username |
    | alice   |
    | bob     |

  Scenario Outline: User signs in successfully without lockout when no failed attempts within fifteen minutes
    Given I am a security officer
